#: regulation-crosswalk.json
msgctxt "regulation-crosswalk.json:disclaimer"
msgid "BomLens does not certify or determine compliance with the EU AI Act, the Korean AI Framework Act, the EU Cyber Resilience Act, or any other regulation. This crosswalk covers only the documentation elements an SBOM can carry; obligations that an SBOM cannot express — bias and fairness assessment, risk management, human oversight — are out of its scope and must be met through separate documents. It makes documentation gaps visible so a person can prepare; interpreting it against a specific product's legal obligations is a person's job."
msgstr "BomLens 不認證、也不判定是否符合 EU 人工智慧法、韓國 AI 基本法、EU 網路韌性法或任何其他法規。本法規對照僅涵蓋 SBOM 能承載的文件化項目；SBOM 無法表達的義務——偏差與公平性評估、風險管理、人為監督——不在其範圍內，須以其他文件另行滿足。這份對照的用意是讓文件缺漏顯而易見、便於著手準備；至於如何對照特定產品的法律義務加以解讀，仍須由人來判斷。"

